---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SOCIAL_LINKS } from '../lib/constants';
---

<BaseLayout title="About · Erkam Uzun" description="Bio, education, expertise, and contact information.">
  <article class="max-w-prose mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 sm:py-20">
    <h1>About</h1>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 mb-8">
      <img
        src="/images/avatar.png"
        alt="Erkam Uzun"
        class="w-24 h-24 rounded-full object-cover flex-shrink-0"
      />
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-2">Erkam Uzun</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-text-muted mb-2">
          Staff Software Engineer & Tech Lead, ID.me
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-text-subtle">Mountain View, CA</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p>
      I'm a software engineer specializing in authentication, identity verification, privacy-preserving
      systems, and large-scale infrastructure. I've shipped foundational services at ID.me (billions
      of monthly transactions) and TikTok (100M+ passkey users), and I hold a PhD in Computer Science
      from Georgia Tech with research in cryptography and biometric security.
    </p>

    <p>
      My work spans the full spectrum from applied cryptography (private set intersection, fully homomorphic
      encryption, zero-knowledge proofs) to production systems engineering (microservices, API design,
      observability) to emerging AI systems (agentic frameworks, multi-agent orchestration).
    </p>

    <h2>Current Role</h2>
    <p>
      At ID.me (2025–present), I architect the company's authentication and identity verification platform,
      leading the re-platforming from monolithic Rails to Java microservices. I designed three foundational
      services now powering org-wide authentication. I also built an agentic AI framework delivering 24×
      productivity multiplier on new service development.
    </p>

    <h2>Education</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Ph.D. in Computer Science</strong>, Georgia Institute of Technology (2015–2021)
        <br />
        Advisor: Prof. Wenke Lee
        <br />
        Dissertation: Security and Privacy in Biometrics-Based Systems
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>M.Sc. in Computer Engineering</strong>, TOBB University of Economics and Technology
        (2012–2014)
        <br />
        Thesis: Analysis and Tamper Detection of Audio Evidence
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>B.Sc. in Computer Engineering & Electrical Engineering</strong>, TOBB University
        (2006–2011)
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Research Areas</h2>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-4">
      {['Post-Quantum Cryptography', 'Private Set Intersection', 'FHE', 'MPC', 'ZKP', 'Biometric Authentication', 'FIDO2/WebAuthn', 'IAM at Scale', 'Agentic AI Systems'].map((area) => (
        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-accent-muted text-accent rounded-full text-sm font-medium">
          {area}
        </span>
      ))}
    </div>

    <h2>Expertise Stack</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 my-6">
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Languages</h3>
        <ul class="text-sm text-text-muted space-y-1">
          <li>Java</li>
          <li>Go</li>
          <li>Python</li>
          <li>Rust</li>
          <li>TypeScript</li>
          <li>Kotlin</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Cryptography</h3>
        <ul class="text-sm text-text-muted space-y-1">
          <li>PSI, FHE, MPC</li>
          <li>ZKP</li>
          <li>Post-Quantum Crypto</li>
          <li>FIDO2/WebAuthn</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Cloud & Infra</h3>
        <ul class="text-sm text-text-muted space-y-1">
          <li>AWS, GCP</li>
          <li>Kubernetes</li>
          <li>Terraform</li>
          <li>Vault, Consul, Nomad</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Tools & Frameworks</h3>
        <ul class="text-sm text-text-muted space-y-1">
          <li>Spring Boot</li>
          <li>Astro, React</li>
          <li>Claude Code</li>
          <li>Prometheus, Grafana</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2>Profiles & Links</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <a href={SOCIAL_LINKS.scholar} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          Google Scholar
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href={SOCIAL_LINKS.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          GitHub: /euzun
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href={SOCIAL_LINKS.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          LinkedIn: /erkamuzun
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        Email: [name][lastname]@gmail.com
      </li>
    </ul>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
